        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>ABH 0340T/EXT-SPIN Top Pivot Center Hung with Extended Spindle for Bottom Pivot</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis heavy duty center hung top pivot hinge is engineered for durability on heavy doors up to 500 lbs.  These are used standard with <a href=\"/products/heavy-door-center-hung-bottom-pivot-abh-0370b\"><b>ABH 0370B Bottom Center Hung Pivot Set</b></a>.  <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=519415\"><b>ABH Door Pivots</b></a> are Made in the USA to insure high quality. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for ABH 0340T/EXT-SPIN  Top Door Pivot:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Weight: Up to 500 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Door Arm Length: 5-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Arm Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Full Mortise, Center Hung</li>\r\n<li>Walking beam type hinge</li>\r\n<li>Dress plate provided for jamb portion</li>\r\n<li><b>Non-Handed, Reversible </b></li>\r\n<li>BHMA/ANSI C06213/3520 (modified)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. Top Door Pivot Only.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Special Ordered Item. NO RETURNS.</b>\r\n</p>",
